<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόξ</span></b> , ἡ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογός</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέγω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flame</i> of fire, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.71
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινὴ δὲ φλὸξ ὦρτο θεείου καιομένοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.135
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς δὲ [νηὸς] κατ᾽ ἀσβέστη κέχυτο
					φλόξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.123
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πῦρ ἐκάη καὶ φλὸξ ἐμαράνθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.212
				</span></i>
			; more fully, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὸξ Ἡφαίστοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.88
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.225
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				914
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				83b
			</span></i>, etc. (but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὸς αἰθέριον πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parm.
					8.56
				</span></i>
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὸς σπέρμα,</span> of live
			charcoal, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.48
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναιθύσσειν, θύειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				344
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IT</u>
				1331
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγείρειν, παρακαλεῖν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβαλεῖν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				120
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβέσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.77
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἀπέσσυτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					859
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορρέουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					67c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὸς ἀποσβεσθείσης</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				58c
			</span></i>: later in pl., <i>flames, meteors,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				341b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				392b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				400a30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fire</i> as an element, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὸς αἶσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parm.
					12.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἱλάειρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					85
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of other
			kinds of <i>flame,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. κεραυνία, οὐρανία,</span> of
			lightning, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1017
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				144
			</span></i> (anap.); of the <i>heat</i> of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pers.</u>
				505
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				696
			</span></i>; <i>flash</i> of a miraculous cloud, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.206
			</span></i>; of precious stones, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχρὰ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					123.5
				</span></i>
			; the <i>blade</i> of a sword, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				3.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				17.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in similes
			and metaphors, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὶ εἴκελος,
			ἶσος,</span> of <i>fiery</i> warriors, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.330
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. οἴνου</span>
			<i>the fiery strength</i> of wine, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				758
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. πήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					166
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wallflower, Cheiranthus Cheiri,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.6.2
			</span></i>.</div>
